# HITL settings on top of fc_params_20261013.params (QGC format: vehicle, component, name, value, type 6 = INT32).
# HIL_ACT_FUNC1..5 inferred from the model ABI (controls[0..4] = left aileron, right aileron, elevator,
# rudder, throttle) and CA_SV_CS0..3 of airframe 2100; HIL_ACT_FUNC1..5 and HIL_ACT_REV were read back from
# the FC's ULog parameters on 2026-10-16 (docs/VALIDATION.md "FC 基準").
# SDLOG_PROFILE 17 = default set + high rate (bit 4): every sample of the controller inputs and outputs, for
# the ULog replay of ROADMAP batch 4h. Logging only; no control parameter changes (decision 14).
1	1	SYS_HITL	1	6
1	1	HIL_ACT_FUNC1	201	6
1	1	HIL_ACT_FUNC2	202	6
1	1	HIL_ACT_FUNC3	203	6
1	1	HIL_ACT_FUNC4	204	6
1	1	HIL_ACT_FUNC5	101	6
1	1	HIL_ACT_REV	2	6
1	1	SDLOG_PROFILE	17	6
